  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 150 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the leucovorin calcium shortage on 2012-01-01 and it has remained on the list for 178 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant on our labels, Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343), received an OAI classification on 2011-08-04, 150 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E30", "E36"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That same plant had earlier OAI inspections on 2010-01-19 (712 days before posting) and 2011-06-17 (198 days before posting), plus a Warning Letter on 2010-04-12 (629 days before posting).",
      "cites": ["D6", "D9", "D7", "E26", "E28", "E35"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another labeled plant, West-Ward Columbus Inc. (FEI 1510690), received a Warning Letter on 2009-03-30 (1007 days before posting) and a VAI inspection on 2011-01-20 (346 days before posting).",
      "cites": ["D4", "D8", "E20", "E17", "E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across our three sites provides 20 to 24 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected purchase option is American Health Packaging, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
